{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smaller angle between the hands of a clock at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e101fc7064d38b0a64c4e2e9ab3e6486c4f7857e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12:25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" /> p.m. is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d835e1c4d6b27eea77dedaeefb4572e829ccbdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 132^\\circ 30&#39;\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 137^\\circ 30&#39;\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 150^\\circ\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 137^\\circ 32&#39;\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 137^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"545\" height=\"18\" />     \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e101fc7064d38b0a64c4e2e9ab3e6486c4f7857e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12:25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />, the minute hand is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/5/465a5f1679e66ea268fa600ad095823b6212de5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25}{60}\\cdot 360^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/d/acd96fce8011b053b9d83a5b2d39ec3c756f0f66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />.\nThe hour hand moves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> 'minutes' every hour, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/a/52a0d5373a2e84ce6b46cde4ff17b194c0bd9b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{60}\\cdot 360 = 30^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"111\" height=\"37\" /> every hour. At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919bf5d461970fc8d905d63704ef763c08594184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> every hour, the hour hand moves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> minutes on the clock every minute. At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e101fc7064d38b0a64c4e2e9ab3e6486c4f7857e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12:25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />, the hour hand is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76c80be0bcde768920afd0bd7cf863d79edfb84b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25}{2}^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"28\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore, the angle between the hands is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/0/23034e5aa2e2da94a4775c75205d5b5e69f1f662.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150^\\circ - \\frac{25}{2}^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"85\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68fc9a5372026610f541f4ef88820d6a660dfecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$137.5^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/3/ba303f3ea93c83384033282cd9c875b1ea128776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$137^{\\circ} 30^{&#39;} \\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/1/5f1b5eb6d937fc9669d56fb4744bdc79f3c6e243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B) 137^\\circ 30&#39;}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"96\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b18891318bf9fce5956aab4e4ab95e5d8988e57e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{|(60h-11m)|}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"111\" height=\"39\" />, and plugging in 12 for h and 25 for m, we get the angle between to be 222.5<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/7844cc52d3798c930feb6212d1916d95a43c470d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 7px\" width=\"6\" height=\"5\" />. Since the problem wants the smaller angle, we do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/810e31e76500f1b15e39c4707c34326640ab4f8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360-222.5 = 137.5 \\Rightarrow 137^{\\circ}30&#39;\\Rightarrow \\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"294\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1955\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/P